msgstr "Removed: the \"?\" badge on the card."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "Changed: when the platform does not answer, the card shows the last data received; error messages are visible only to editors."
msgstr "Changed: when the platform does not answer, the card shows the last data received; error messages are visible only to editors."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "New: the date tooltip shows the time since the last update."
msgstr "New: the date tooltip shows the time since the last update."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "New: main language, license and \"Archived\" label."
msgstr "New: main language, license and \"Archived\" label."

#. Found in changelog list item.
