msgstr "New: Download button for the latest release."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "New: platform logos for GitHub, Codeberg, Forgejo and Gitea; Gitea instances are now recognized."
msgstr "New: platform logos for GitHub, Codeberg, Forgejo and Gitea; Gitea instances are now recognized."

