msgstr "New: the Avatar option also shows the plugin icon."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "New: cards for plugins in the WordPress.org directory, with plugin page, download, tested WordPress version, active installations and rating."
msgstr "New: cards for plugins in the WordPress.org directory, with plugin page, download, tested WordPress version, active installations and rating."

#. Found in changelog list item.
