msgstr "New: links to documentation, repository and donations at the bottom of the settings page."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "Changed: WordPress.org plugins without ratings show 0, like repositories without stars."
msgstr "Changed: WordPress.org plugins without ratings show 0, like repositories without stars."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "Fixed: the card follows the width of the post content."
msgstr "Fixed: the card follows the width of the post content."

